:: R1_Choice_A [r1 story]
<<modstat "marriageBond" -2>>
<<set $flags.triedGoDown = true>>

<<sayself>>Hey. Let me...<</sayself>>

I start to move down, pulling the blanket. She puts her hand on my shoulder. Gentle, but firm.

<<say "Lena">>I'm tired, babe.<</say>>

The word "babe" is a closed door with a welcome mat in front of it. It sounds like affection. It functions as a perimeter.

I stop. Move back up. Lie beside her.

<<sayself>>Okay.<</sayself>>

<<say "Lena">>Long day.<</say>>

She adds it, and I can't tell if she's explaining or apologizing or just narrating so the silence doesn't settle too thick.

<<sayself>>Yeah.<</sayself>>

She rolls to her side, facing away. Phone light disappearing under the pillow. I lie on my back and feel the rejection like a small, cold stone in my stomach. Not painful. Worn smooth. I've swallowed this stone before.

The chip in the nightstand holds no answers. I check anyway.

